---
import { getEntry } from "astro:content";

import { getPageById } from "../config/site-manifest";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const aboutPage = getPageById("about");
const aboutSeo = await getEntry("pages", "about");

if (!aboutPage) {
  throw new Error("Could not find the 'about' page config.");
}

if (!aboutSeo) {
  throw new Error("Could not find the 'about' page metadata.");
}
---

<BaseLayout
  page={aboutPage}
  seo={aboutSeo.data}
  mainClass="site-main site-main--about"
  footerVariant="dark"
>
  <section class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <h1 id="about-title">Why we built Bolus</h1>
      <p class="about-hero__dek">A note from our team</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-manifesto" aria-label="About Bolus">
      <p>
        We built Bolus to make anesthesia charting easier in real practice.
      </p>

      <p>
        The goal was simple. Create an anesthesia record that is fast to complete, clear to read,
        and easy to stand behind later. It had to fit into the existing workflow of
        office-based anesthesia and sedation. It had to make charting easier, not harder.
      </p>

      <p>
        Paper records are still common in these settings. They are slow to manage. They are hard to
        keep organized. They can be messy, difficult to read, and harder to defend when reviewed
        later.
      </p>

      <p>
        Bolus was built to offer a better option. A clean record. A simple workflow. A tool that
        helps providers chart quickly and move on with confidence.
      </p>

      <p>
        We also believe good tools should be accessible. Bolus is designed to be one of the most
        affordable options on the market, so providers can modernize their workflow without taking
        on unnecessary overhead.
      </p>

      <p>
        That is the mission. Build an anesthesia record that supports modern practice with clarity,
        speed, and defensibility.
      </p>

      <p>
        We hope you enjoy using it. Please reach out to <a href="mailto:contact@bolusanesthesia.com" style="color: #007AFF; font-weight: 600;">contact@bolusanesthesia.com</a> with any suggestions or comments.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
